      "text": "A\nThe owner changes; the CLI stays.",
      "href": "#focus=ownership&level=1",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "B\nFirst return wins. Work stays lazy.",
      "href": "#focus=lazy&level=1",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "01\nAbsence and failure differ.",
      "href": "#focus=absent&level=1",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "02\nStarting beats the record version.",
      "href": "#focus=starting&level=1",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "03\nA wrong record version stops here.",
      "href": "#focus=mismatch&level=1",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "04\nThe observer has a different priority.",
      "href": "#focus=warm&level=1",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "C\nA routing stop is not an I/O ban.",
      "href": "#focus=dispatch&level=1",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
      "id": "",
      "text": "D\nMeasured effects, bounded claims.",
      "href": "#focus=tests&level=1",
      "visible": true
    },
